reminderConfirmation.body:
Hi,

please confirm with one click that we may email you once the application window opens:

{confirmUrl}

If this wasn't you, you can simply ignore this email.

Unsubscribe any time: {unsubscribeUrl}

reminderAlreadyRegistered.body:
Hi,

this email address is already registered and confirmed for the application-start notification. You'll automatically hear from us once the next application window opens, there's nothing further for you to do.

If this wasn't you, you can unsubscribe any time here: {unsubscribeUrl}

reminderWindowOpen.body:
Hi,

the application window is now open. You can apply until {endsAt}:

{applyUrl}

Unsubscribe any time: {unsubscribeUrl}
